1 NAME Petter Olaf /Sten/
2 GIVN Petter Olaf
2 _MARNM Sten
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 13 FEB 1908
2 PLAC Steen
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fluberg
3 STAE Oppland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 26 APR 1908
