1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/156139577/martha-neoma-shaner
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Neoma Gilbertson was born July 29, 1926, in Pelican Rapids, MN, to Gust and Olga (Enger) Gilbertson. She graduated from Barnesville (MN) High School.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha married Vern Dale Shaner on October 29, 1946, in Hawley, MN, and they lived in Rothsay, MN, before moving to Barnesville in 1947. They moved to Glyndon, MN, in 1959. Vern died on October 7, 1998, and Martha continued to liv
2 CONC e in Glyndon. Under the loving care of her family and Hospice of the Red River Valley, Martha died at home on Wednesday, December 16, 2015, at eighty-nine years of age. She is survived by her children, Allan (Margaret) Shaner, Fra
2 CONC zee, MN, Vernes (Ric) Koval, Lafayette, MN, and Hazel (Tim) Johnson, Stephenson, MI; daughter-in-law, Jody (Louie) Eidenschink, Detroit Lakes, MN; six grandchildren; one stepgrandson; eleven great-grandchildren; brothers, Orrie (A
2 CONC rlene) Gilbertson, Pelican Rapids, and Gordon Gilbertson, Barnesville; sister, Etta Bekkerus, Glyndon; seventeen nieces and nephews and their spouses; and numerous grandnieces, grandnephews, and their children.
2 CONT
2 CONT In addition to her parents and her husband, Martha was preceded in death by her son, Elwood; and her sister-in-law, Claudia Gilbertson.
