2 CONT 1851 (8 Aug.) Henrik Olsen Dahl (24 år) left Romedal, Hedmark, Norway for Amerika.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born “Hendrick Olsen Dahl” on 28 Nov 1827 at Hjernstad, Stange, Norway. From Hedemarken, Norway. Civil War: Enlisted for three years on 1 Jul 1862 at Waco, McLennan County, Texas. Private. TX 30th Cavalry Co C. CSA. Post war: Died
2 CONC  in Norse, Bosque County, Texas, 13 Jan 1873. Sources: ("Norwegian Soldiers in Confederate Forces" by C.A.Clausen & Derwood Johnson, publ. in Norwegian-American Studies, volume 25, Northfield, Minnesota. p114) (Ulvestad p275) (www
2 CONC .borgerkrigen.info) (Betty Nelson, Decorah, Iowa))	Bosque Co., Texas. https://collections.vesterheim.org/civil_war_database/dahl-henrik-o/
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * '''Residence''': Kaufman County - 1853
2 CONT * '''Residence''': almost six miles SW of the present town of Clifton, Gary Creek valley, Bosque Co, TX, USA - 1854
