2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Ludwig was the daughter of Jorgen and Christine Jorgenson in Clifton, Texas. She was baptized and confirmed at Trinity Lutheran Church in Clifton, Texas. She was a charter member of Advent Lutheran Church. Ruth was preceded i
2 CONC n death by her parents, eight brothers and sisters and her grandson, Brian Ludwig. She is survived by her husband of 55 years, Edward Ludwig; daughter, Linda Holmes and husband Terry ; sons, David Ludwig and John Ludwig and wife N
2 CONC orma; grandchildren, Jason Holmes, Leslie Holmes, Laura Ludwig, Christopher Ludwig and wife Candice, Jennifer Taylor and husband Daryl along with numerous nieces and nephews. 
2 CONT
2 CONT From the Houston Chronicle on December 29, 2008 
