2 CONT Geneva Jean Jorgenson Tucker, age 79, passed away on November 17, 2014 at home with her loving family by her side. Geneva was a life-long Longview resident, born on August 23, 1935 to Jacob and Lurlie Jorgenson. Growing up she att
2 CONC ended local schools here and graduated from Judson Grove High School. Those left to cherish her memory is her loving husband, Ray Tucker, her daughter, Renea Tucker-Click, grandchildren, Casey, Danielle, Jessica and Billy, great-g
2 CONC randchildren, Trey, Kaylyn, Lathen, Bri, Thomas Jr., Knova, Xaivia, LaLove, and Kenny Jr. Her son, Anthony Ray Tucker precedes her in passing. Geneva will be sorely missed by all. Friends are welcome to join the family for a time 
2 CONC of visitation 6:00 p.m. until 8:00 p.m. on Friday, November 21, 2014 at Rader Funeral Home in Longview. Funeral services will be the next day, Saturday, November 22, 2014 at 10:00 a.m. at Firsts Lutheran Church of Longview. Interm
2 CONC ent will follow services at LaGrones Chapel Cemetery.
