2 CONT
2 CONT * Census year: 1900 Trondheim: [http://www.rhd.uit.no/folketellinger/ftliste_e.aspx?ft=1900&knr=1601&kenr=026&bnr=0023&lnr=02 Christian Thaulow]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Census year: 1910 Trondheim: [http://www.rhd.uit.no/folketellinger/ftliste_e.aspx?ft=1910&knr=1601&kenr=012&bnr=0011&lnr=03 Christian Thaulow]
