1 NOTE {geni:about_me} OLE P. MELAAS, b. 15 Sep 1870, Bluffton Twp., Winneshiek Co., IA. He moved his family to Wells Co., ND (near Harvey, Manfred, and Fessenden) in 1907, then returned to Fergus Falls, Ottertail Co., MN in 1913. He was
2 CONC  a farmer and a thresherman. d. 30 Aug 1944, Fergus Falls, Ottertail Co., MN, bur. at Rock Prairie Cemetery, near Elbow Lake, MN. m. 21 May 1894, Rock Prairie Lutheran Church, near Elbow Lake, MN, to THEA G. RUND, b. 25 Nov 1876, 
2 CONC Ottertail Co., MN, dau. of Gul Trulson Rund and Margit Ericksdatter Foslien. She was a homemaker. d. 22 Aug 1954, Stonybrook Twp., Grant Co., MN, bur. at Rock Prairie Cemetery, near Elbow Lake, MN.
