2 CONT Birth:  May 5, 1913 Maple Bay Polk County Minnesota, USA  Death:  Oct. 23, 1990 Edina Hennepin County Minnesota, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Reuben I. Hovland, son of Ingel and Gurine Hovland, married Marion Nelson on Aug. 24, 1937 in Sand Creek, WI. He was manager for the Farmer Store in Chetek, WI for 33 years. He was survived by his wife, Marion of Fort Myers, FL; d
2 CONC aughter, Jean Woog of Rseville, MN; son Dale Hovland of Minneapolis, MN; brother, Joseph Hovland of Naples, FL; sisters, Esther Helland and Lynn Green, bot of Edina, MN; one granddaughter and one grandson. Funeral service at Chete
2 CONC k Lutheran Church. Burial at Lake View Cemetery, Chetek, WI. (News-Press, 10/26/90)  
