2 CONT Third wife: Nancy Ward. Children: Daniel Jerome Hovland 23 Feb 1949 MN-; (Adopted Amelie Farley's children) Karin Dorothy 1946 Germany-; Robert Joseph 12 Nov 1948 MN-; Steven Alexander 28 Sept 1951 MN; David C. 1952 MN- Grandchild
2 CONC ren: Jody Hovland 5 July 1969 Naples, FL-; Andrew Hovland 21 Sept 1980 Sarasota, FL-. Great Grandchildren: Kayleigh 1987 FL-, Brenna 1995 FL-, Meigan 1997 FL-; Sean Bonthron 1 June 1998 FL-. Great, Great Grandchildren: Camden 2013
