1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Third Generation (Grandparents)
2 CONT
2 CONT Morten Ericksen, son of Erich Torgersen and Kari Andersdtr, was born in Jan 1638 in Brandbu, Oppland, Norway and died on 20 Apr 1716 in Gran Oppland, Norway 78 yrs. 3 mo. at age 78. General Notes: died: Source information: Oppland
2 CONC  county, Gran, Parish register (official) nr. 1 (1707-1731), Chronological list 1716, page 76. 20 April 1716 Morten married someone Ingrid Hansdtr Ericksen in 1673 in Gran, Norway. Ingrid was born in 1651 in Gran Oppland, Norway a
