2 CONT Obit of  Arthur C. EMBERSON [excerpts] Arthur C. EMBERSON, 84, Monroe, formerly of rural Argyle, died Fri 25 Oct 1990...Darlington.  He was the son of Anton & Carrie (LAGESON) EMBERSON, born 1 Apr 1906 in Blanchard Twp.  He marrie
2 CONC d Thilda BERG 20 Feb 1930 at Adams Lutheran Church...lived and farmed in the Argyle & Blanchardville area before retiring to Monroe in 1966...was a member of Adams Lutheran Church. Surviving are two sons, Olin of rural Blanchardvi
2 CONC lle & Roland of Browntown; two daughters, Mrs [A] Charles (Clarice) GOEPFERT of Browntown & Ruth OLSON of Fontana CA; two brothers, Glenn of rural Argyle & Everette of Madison; a sister, Mrs Sherman (Clara) HERMANSON of Blanchardv
2 CONC ille; six grandchildren & four great grandchildren...was preceded in death by his wife, 1 Oct 1990; a sister, Alma HERMANSON; and four brothers, Marion, Henry, Bennie & Willard. Funeral...Wed [30 Oct 1990] at Argyle Lutheran Churc
2 CONC h with the Rev Lyman OMAN officiating.  Burial...Adams Lutheran Cemetery...[Note:  A Charles GOEPFERT of Browntown is my stepbrother] 
2 CONT
