1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In the "RA, 1801 census for 0416P Romedal, 1801", Jens Jensen, who was a reserve dragoon (Norwegian ''Reserve Dragoun''), and his wife, Mari Anders Datter, lived at Østre Arneberg in Romedal. They had two daughters
2 CONC :
2 CONT
2 CONT * Anne Jens Datter (Age 3).
2 CONT
2 CONT * Gonnor Jens Datter (Age 2).
2 CONT
2 CONT Jens Jensen was 29 years of age and Mari Anders Datter 21 years of age. According to the "RA, 1801 census for 0416P Romedal, 1801", both Jens Jensen and Mari Anders Datter were in their first marriage.
2 CONT
