1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bertha Ella Dahl Clingman, 90, of Oklahoma City, Oklahoma
2 CONT
2 CONT The Daily Oklahoman (Oklahoma City, Oklahoma) — Sunday, February 16, 1997
2 CONT
2 CONT Bertha Ella, age 90, passed away Feb. 11, 1997 at Brookwood Nursing Center in Oklahoma City. She was born in Fairview, Ok. March 6, 1906. Bertha Ella Dahl and Walter Clingman were married June 5, 1926 in Chickasha, Ok. They had be
2 CONC en married 45 years when he passed away in October 1981. They had 1 child, Frances Brazil, who lives in Albion, Ca; 4 grandchildren, Roger, Richard, and Randy Spurlock, all of OKC, and Rhonda Hayes of Missouri. Bertha also has 7 g
2 CONC reat grandchildren; a brother, Ernest Dahl, and a sister, Vinita Woody, both of OKC. A brother, Ole Dahl, preceded her in death. A host of family and friends will remember her with love. She was a member of Crestwood Baptist Churc
2 CONC h in OKC. Services will be Wednesday, Feb. 19, at Bill Merritt Memorial Chapel, Bethany, with burial at Chapel Hill Memorial Gardens.
