2 CONT Vernie Anita Roetschke
2 CONT
2 CONT Vernie Roetschke, 86, passed away Tuesday, Dec. 24, 2013. Funeral: 1:30 p.m. Saturday in Greenwood Funeral Home Chapel. Interment: Greenwood Memorial Park. Visitation: 6 to 8 p.m. Friday at Greenwood Funeral Home. Memorials: Light
2 CONC house Fellowship Church. Vernie was born Aug. 03, 1927 in Bosque County to William and Amelia Eckert. She was preceded in death by her husband, Jimmie, in 2010. Survivors: Daughters, Terry O'Grady, and Robyn Frizzell and husband, 
2 CONC Herman; grandchildren, Michelle Hampton and husband, David, Jamie Beasley and Anthony Campisi, Tyler Frizzell, Dalton Frizzell, Taylor Lauren O'Grady, and Garrett O'Grady; and great-grandchildren, Kyler Anderson, Skyler Hampton, a
2 CONC nd Lily Campisi.
2 CONT
