1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Larry was born and raised in St. Petersburg, FL. He was a uniquely gifted artist, a skill which he took into his professional life as well. As a youth he was happy, fun-loving, and daring. He could climb anything a
2 CONC nd enjoyed, camping, boy scouts, and playing in a baseball league where he showed a talent as a center fielder. In 1981 he graduated from Dixie Hollins High School. He had a love for the beach and enjoyed sailing lessons with one 
2 CONC of his brothers. Larry was a very likable person, everyone's friend, who loved life. His mother was Laura B. Rikansrud, and his father is Erling N. Rikansrud. He has four brothers, Evan, Ronald, Edward, and Eric. He will be missed
2 CONC  by all who had the privilege of knowing him.
